OL,3,GNEWSAIVF for single women to be
OL,4,Aconsidered in NHS review
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government has launched a
OL,7,Fnational review into whether IVF
OL,8,Ftreatment on the NHS should be extended
OL,9,Fto single women.
OL,11,FThe review ` which is due to release
OL,12,Fits findings next summer - will also
OL,13,Fconsider whether greater access should
OL,14,Fbe offered to couples who have children
OL,15,Ffrom previous relationships.
OL,17,FHealth Secretary Angela Constance said:
OL,18,F"Access to NHS IVF treatment should be
OL,19,Ffair, timely and reflect the way
OL,20,Fpeople's lives and families look
OL,21,Ftoday."
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
